Upstream attribution:

This package contains TypeScript code translated from WjCryptLib's
SHA-512 implementation at https://github.com/WaterJuice/WjCryptLib
(WjCryptLib_Aes.c, WjCryptLib_AesCbc.c, headers). The upstream library is
released into the public domain under the Unlicense.

Algorithm: AES-CBC: AES (FIPS 197) + CBC mode (NIST SP 800-38A §6.2).
